Description: harden runtime verification, extraction, and desktop dispatch
 Verify the complete Wine manifest before executing the candidate, reject root
 at every entry point before honoring user-controlled paths, authenticate the
 pinned Arch package signature, preflight archive paths and links, and support
 Debian's x-terminal-emulator interface. Add regression coverage and update
 the affected security documentation.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/mitzracing/live-for-speed-linux
Forwarded: not-yet
Author: Mitz Racing <300233368+mitzracing@users.noreply.github.com>
Last-Update: 2026-09-01

